{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v1",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "nvsentinel-latency-errors-reference"
  },
  "spec": {
    "__inputs": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "description": "Prometheus datasource containing NVSentinel and Kubernetes metrics",
        "type": "datasource",
        "pluginId": "prometheus",
        "pluginName": "Prometheus"
      }
    ],
    "annotations": {
      "list": [
        {
          "builtIn": 1,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana",
            "uid": "-- Grafana --"
          },
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
          "type": "dashboard"
        }
      ]
    },
    "description": "Reference dashboard for NVSentinel latency, errors, deployment health, GPU health, node draining, MongoDB, and fault quarantine. Requires k8s_cluster_name on all queried series. See https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVSentinel.",
    "editable": true,
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "id": null,
    "links": [],
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Requirements and scope",
        "description": "Metric assumptions and dependencies.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 13
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "### Assumptions\n- Every queried series carries the Prometheus label `k8s_cluster_name` (from the OpenTelemetry resource attribute `k8s.cluster.name`).\n\n### Metric dependencies\n- **NVSentinel component metrics:** fault quarantine, GPU health monitor, node drainer, and related latency/error metrics. Metric availability can vary by NVSentinel version and enabled components.\n- **kube-state-metrics:** deployment, StatefulSet, DaemonSet, and pod health for the `nvsentinel` namespace.\n- **MongoDB exporter:** `mongodb_*` metrics for NVSentinel's MongoDB deployment.\n\nMissing components leave their corresponding panels empty."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Deployment Health",
        "description": "Requires kube-state-metrics for resources in the nvsentinel namespace.",
        "collapsed": false,
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 1
        },
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Unavailable deployments",
        "description": "Deployments whose Available condition is false.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 14,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 6
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_deployment_status_condition{namespace=\"nvsentinel\",k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=\"Available\",status=\"false\"} == 1)",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}}",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Deployments not progressing",
        "description": "Deployments whose Progressing condition is false.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 6,
          "y": 14,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 6
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_deployment_status_condition{namespace=\"nvsentinel\",k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=\"Progressing\",status=\"false\"} == 1)",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}}",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "StatefulSets with unready replicas",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 14,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 6
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_statefulset_replicas{namespace=\"nvsentinel\",k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"} - kube_statefulset_status_replicas_ready{namespace=\"nvsentinel\",k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"})",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}}",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
